Package: debian-dev-setup
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: curl, wget, apt-transport-https, ca-certificates, gnupg, lsb-release, software-properties-common
Maintainer: GHOST117s <your-email@example.com>
Description: Complete Debian Developer Environment Setup
 This package installs a comprehensive development environment for Debian-based
 systems including PHP 8.2 with Laravel, Node.js via NVM, Python 3, VS Code,
 Docker, Redis, MySQL Workbench, and many other essential development tools.
 .
 Features:
  - Automatic Docker container management
  - PHP 8.2 with Laravel extensions and Redis support
  - Node.js LTS via NVM
  - VS Code with Fira Code font and extensions
  - Database tools (MySQL Workbench, HeidiSQL, DBeaver, Redis)
  - API testing tools (Postman, Insomnia)
  - Enhanced terminal (Oh My Zsh, Terminator)
  - Media and communication tools (VLC, Firefox Dev, Discord, Spotify)
